ARCHIVAL NOTE
-------------
This repository is moved to Sourcehut[1].



cal13 - 13 Months calendar
-----

I'm just trying to implement things. Run `make check` for run testsuite. Just
running `make` will just build the binary.

Involving
---------
Main development is done in Sourcehut[1]. You can send patches to mailing list.
If you prefix subject with correct project name, it will trigger CI/CD to run
tests on patchset.


